Palmimo face display firmware

This bundle includes firmware 0.1.3+6ea1932, declared by firmware.json in
/usr/local/lib/palmimo/display-firmware alongside face_serial.bin.gz.
The updater installs it during boot and Portal platform updates.

Firmware binaries installed in /usr/local/lib/palmimo/display-firmware are
Jizai's copyrighted work and are excluded from this repository's license.
Their third-party notices and full license texts are in NOTICE and licenses/
in this directory. The canonical copies are in the repository's
files/boot/firmware/licenses/display-firmware/; tests require byte equality.
